This repository also vendors modified infrastructure (UNet backbone, DWT/IDWT
wiring, logging/distributed-training utilities, base training-loop skeleton)
originally released under the MIT License as part of WFM:

  WFM: 3D Wavelet Flow Matching for Ultrafast Multi-Modal MRI Synthesis
  Yalcin Tur, Mihajlo Stojkovic, Ulas Bagci — MIDL 2026
  https://github.com/yalcintur/WFM

which itself builds upon cWDM / wdm-3d (Paul Friedrich et al., MIT License):
  https://github.com/pfriedri/wdm-3d

This MIT license does NOT cover the `DWT_IDWT/` directory (the Haar
DWT/IDWT implementation), which is separately licensed under CC BY-NC-SA
4.0 (Adobe Inc.) — see `DWT_IDWT/LICENSE` and `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.

